Mockup Description for Place Details Screen (Version 1 – Basic Layout)

This is a basic wireframe of the Place Details Screen for Travel Map Discovery App.

Layout:

Top: Large image of the location
Center: Place name, rating, short description, tips
Bottom: User reviews list and Save button

Hierarchy:

Primary: Place image and title
Secondary: Reviews and tips

Usability:

Clear call-to-action with Save button
Scrolling layout for easy reading
Minimal design to focus on content